# CLI toolbelt for the REMOTE LINUX VM only, via bootstrap.sh (`brew bundle`).
#
# The Mac is no longer provisioned from this file. Its packages are declared in
# nix/darwin.nix and applied with `rebuild`. Two files for two machines, on
# purpose: nix-darwin's homebrew module does not run on Linux.
#
# A tool you want in both places must be added to BOTH files. Nothing checks
# that for you.
#
# tmux stays here because the VM still uses it (bootstrap.sh links
# tmux/tmux.conf). Only the Mac moved to herdr.
